# Result: the pending add POST (990008, header moduleId=1) went out in the same ms as DELETE cart/remove; the DELETE finished first (197ms), the add after (359ms) -> stray old-module row 1058 survives server-side next to the new basket row 1059 (mod 3). App UI shows only Zqx Pill (cart/list is module-scoped) - the old row reappears on a switch back to Grocery.
# Cause: clearCartOnline cancels the snapshotted debounce timers only AFTER a successful clear (by design: cancel only on success); a timer that fires during the round trip is not held.
# Same family, stepper update variant (22:50:30): pending cart/update for row 1053 fired 500ms after the DELETE was sent -> 404 rowGone, logged [FAIL] 'cart: updateCartQuantityOnline rowGone' corr c0f40e34-5822-492c-9e1c-52c81ee2cec0, no toast, basket correct.
